{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大号标题，首先被白色粗体和紫色强调词吸引，尤其是“不再需要他陪”和“不自在了呢”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他开始担心对方有一天不再需要自己陪伴，甚至会觉得和自己待在一起不自在。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、担心、不安。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他刚才突然安静下来，不敢继续往下想；眼下两人其实仍然亲近，对方没有退开，他因此也有些高兴。这层现实中的积极感受不容易在第一眼抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上、中、下三块都有较大的粗体文字和醒目的竖线，彼此争夺主视线。\",\n    \"上方主标题虽然有紫色关键词突出，但标题整体较长，强调的担忧与句首的情绪词没有形成特别集中的视觉焦点。\",\n    \"中间的安静与下方的高兴又引入了不同的情绪信息，容易分散对当前核心不安的注意力。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "faea7b69-a254-4b20-a3f2-7e586c6c16a6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011047375301Z", "elapsed_seconds": 46.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:11:33.922022+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4f0a07f35dd38f7d469584b7df842bc4330f7defb3020d26d1ab0a228b18d2d8", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31